    {
      "name": "Support Chat API",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1️⃣ Open Support Chat Thread",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// Save threadId from response for subsequent requests",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const response = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.environment.set('threadId', response.id);",
                  "    console.log('✅ Thread created:', response.id);",
                  "    console.log('📝 Recent messages:', response.recentMessages.length);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"tenantId\": \"{{tenantId}}\",\n  \"customerId\": \"{{customerId}}\",\n  \"customerUserId\": \"{{customerUserId}}\",\n  \"customerDisplayName\": \"John Doe\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/chat",
            "description": "**Step 1: Open a chat thread**\n\nOpens a new support chat thread for an order. Returns the thread with participants and recent messages.\n\n**Auto-saves:** threadId to environment variables for next steps"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2️⃣ Connect WebSocket (Customer)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// Validate required variables",
                  "const threadId = pm.environment.get('threadId');",
                  "const customerUserId = pm.environment.get('customerUserId');",
                  "",
                  "if (!threadId) {",
                  "    throw new Error('❌ threadId not set! Run \"1️⃣ Open Support Chat Thread\" first');",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "console.log('🔌 Connecting to thread:', threadId);",
                  "console.log('👤 As user:', customerUserId);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "WEBSOCKET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{wsUrl}}/ws/chat?threadId={{threadId}}&senderId={{customerUserId}}&role=Customer",
              "host": ["{{wsUrl}}"],
              "path": ["ws", "chat"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "threadId",
                  "value": "{{threadId}}",
                  "description": "Chat thread UUID (from Open Chat endpoint)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "senderId",
                  "value": "{{customerUserId}}",
                  "description": "Customer user UUID"
                },
                {
                  "key": "role",
                  "value": "Customer",
                  "description": "Participant role: Customer, Support, or System"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Step 2: Connect via WebSocket as Customer**\n\n**Connection URL:** `ws://host/ws/chat?threadId={uuid}&senderId={uuid}&role=Customer`\n\n**Query Parameters:**\n- `threadId` (required) - Chat thread UUID\n- `senderId` (required) - User UUID\n- `role` (required) - \"Customer\", \"Support\", or \"System\"\n\n**Ping/Pong:** Send `ping` to receive `pong`\n\n**Message Format (Send):**\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"message\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"contentType\": 1,\n    \"body\": \"Hello!\"\n  },\n  \"clientMessageId\": \"unique-uuid\"\n}\n```\n\n**Message Format (Receive):**\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"message\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"id\": \"msg-uuid\",\n    \"threadId\": \"thread-uuid\",\n    \"senderId\": \"user-uuid\",\n    \"senderRole\": 1,\n    \"contentType\": 1,\n    \"body\": \"Message text\",\n    \"sentAt\": \"2024-12-08T10:30:00Z\",\n    \"status\": 1\n  },\n  \"clientMessageId\": \"unique-uuid\"\n}\n```",
            "websocket": {
              "message": [
                {
                  "data": "{\n  \"type\": \"message\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"contentType\": 1,\n    \"body\": \"Hello! I need help with my order.\"\n  },\n  \"clientMessageId\": \"{{$guid}}\"\n}",
                  "description": "Send a text message"
                },
                {
                  "data": "ping",
                  "description": "Ping to keep connection alive"
                },
                {
                  "data": "{\n  \"type\": \"message\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"contentType\": 1,\n    \"body\": \"Is anyone there?\"\n  },\n  \"clientMessageId\": \"{{$guid}}\"\n}",
                  "description": "Send follow-up message"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3️⃣ Connect WebSocket (Support)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// Validate required variables",
                  "const threadId = pm.environment.get('threadId');",
                  "const supportUserId = pm.environment.get('supportUserId');",
                  "",
                  "if (!threadId) {",
                  "    throw new Error('❌ threadId not set! Run \"1️⃣ Open Support Chat Thread\" first');",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "console.log('🔌 Support agent connecting to thread:', threadId);",
                  "console.log('👤 As user:', supportUserId);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "WEBSOCKET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{wsUrl}}/ws/chat?threadId={{threadId}}&senderId={{supportUserId}}&role=Support",
              "host": ["{{wsUrl}}"],
              "path": ["ws", "chat"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "threadId",
                  "value": "{{threadId}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "senderId",
                  "value": "{{supportUserId}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "role",
                  "value": "Support"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Step 3: Connect via WebSocket as Support Agent**\n\nConnect as support staff to respond to customer messages. All messages sent will have `senderRole: 2` (Support).\n\n**Use Case:** Simulate support agent responding to customer inquiries.",
            "websocket": {
              "message": [
                {
                  "data": "{\n  \"type\": \"message\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"contentType\": 1,\n    \"body\": \"Hello! How can I help you today?\"\n  },\n  \"clientMessageId\": \"{{$guid}}\"\n}",
                  "description": "Support agent greeting"
                },
                {
                  "data": "{\n  \"type\": \"message\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"contentType\": 1,\n    \"body\": \"I've checked your order status. Let me help you with that.\"\n  },\n  \"clientMessageId\": \"{{$guid}}\"\n}",
                  "description": "Support agent response"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4️⃣ Get Chat Messages (HTTP)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/chat/{{threadId}}/messages?take=50",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "chat", "{{threadId}}", "messages"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "take",
                  "value": "50",
                  "description": "Number of messages to retrieve (default: 50, max: 100)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "beforeMessageId",
                  "value": "{{beforeMessageId}}",
                  "description": "Load messages before this message ID (for pagination)",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Step 4: Retrieve message history via HTTP**\n\nFetches chat messages from a thread. Useful for:\n- Loading initial message history\n- Pagination of older messages\n- Syncing after reconnection\n\n**Pagination:** Enable `beforeMessageId` and set to a message UUID to load older messages."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "5️⃣ Send Message (HTTP Fallback)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"senderId\": \"{{customerUserId}}\",\n  \"senderRole\": 1,\n  \"contentType\": 1,\n  \"body\": \"This message sent via HTTP (WebSocket fallback)\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/chat/{{threadId}}/messages",
            "description": "**Step 5: Send message via HTTP (Fallback)**\n\nUse when WebSocket is unavailable or for server-side integrations.\n\n**Enumerations:**\n\n**senderRole:**\n- `1` = Customer\n- `2` = Support\n- `3` = System\n\n**contentType:**\n- `1` = Text\n- `2` = Image\n- `3` = System notification\n\n**status (returned):**\n- `1` = Sent\n- `2` = Delivered\n- `3` = Read"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
